        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Brass Accents A07-K5000, Solid Brass 7-1/2 High Large Lion Head Door Knocker</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis is a gorgeous solid brass lion head door knocker was first popular in England during the Victorian Era. Its large 7-1/2\" size makes an imposing statement on any entry door.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nBrass Accents provides distinctive craftsmanship with old-world tradition for a lifetime of elegance. Their products are hand finished in the USA. They are one of the world's leading crafters of cast-brass and hot-forged decorative brass hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nClick here for <a href=\"/products/small-lion-door-knocker-brass-accents-a07-k5010\">Small Lion Head Door Knocker</a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nClick here for <a href=\"/products/8-3-8-leo-door-knocker-brass-accents-a07-k5100\">Leo Door Knocker</a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Large Lion Head Door Knocker:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Height: 7-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Knocker Width: 3-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 4-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 3-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Max Thickness: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Solid Brass</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
